    }
  ],
  "manual_review_boundaries": [
    "A travel destination alone does not prove that the destination is an officially designated risk area.",
    "Unknown maternal HBsAg status must never be treated as a documented negative result.",
    "Unassessed BCG scar/nodule evidence must remain different from assessed-and-absent evidence.",
    "A reported disease event remains distinct from a documented disease event.",
    "If a required disease/exposure date is unknown, the future rule must fail closed rather than invent a date.",
    "Complex RIE/CRIE and risk-benefit branches may return special_pathway_review rather than automatic eligibility."
  ],
